  "notes": "Cash basis county. Governmental lines from the Total Governmental Funds column (p4); roll-forward 4,334,256 + 9,890,481 - 10,255,705 + 1,759,480 - 1,759,480 = 3,969,032. Taxes 3,567,546 split: Inheritance Tax Fund taxes 267,201 (fund name) and the rest 3,300,345 (General 3,240,737 + nonmajor 59,608) kept taxes (unlabeled): the Statement of Activities prints only 'Property and other taxes' 3,567,546. The Statement of Activities (p2) shows disbursements 9,926,129 and receipts 9,560,905, both 329,576 lower than the fund statement (general government netted); fund statement used. Balance sheet from the governmental funds Statement of Assets and Fund Balances (p3), totals equal the Statement of Net Position (p1). Detail: budget schedules for General, Road and Bridge, Road Sinking, Transit Service, Inheritance Tax and Capital Projects funds (pp5-11) and the combined Nonmajor Funds budget schedule (pp12-13, by function and object); the nonmajor combining schedule (p14, per-fund totals only) is not recorded to avoid double counting. Debt Service lines printed inside function headings are recorded as debt service (principal and interest combined). Read pages 1-14 of 14"
